From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Fervi (IntinteDAO)" <lordfervi@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] audio: prefer AAudio and AndroidAudio over OpenSL ES

OpenSL ES is deprecated since Android 11 (API 30) and its buffer queue
callbacks deadlock or fail on modern 64-bit Android (14/15/16/17+).
Reordering bootstrap ensures AAudio (API 27+) is selected first, followed
by Android AudioTrack via JNI, with OpenSL ES only as legacy fallback.
---
 src/audio/SDL_audio.c | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/audio/SDL_audio.c b/src/audio/SDL_audio.c
index 8933b93..14dbfa2 100644
--- a/src/audio/SDL_audio.c
+++ b/src/audio/SDL_audio.c
@@ -95,15 +95,15 @@ static const AudioBootStrap *const bootstrap[] = {
 #ifdef SDL_AUDIO_DRIVER_FUSIONSOUND
     &FUSIONSOUND_bootstrap,
 #endif
-#ifdef SDL_AUDIO_DRIVER_OPENSLES
-    &openslES_bootstrap,
-#endif
 #ifdef SDL_AUDIO_DRIVER_AAUDIO
     &aaudio_bootstrap,
 #endif
 #ifdef SDL_AUDIO_DRIVER_ANDROID
     &ANDROIDAUDIO_bootstrap,
 #endif
+#ifdef SDL_AUDIO_DRIVER_OPENSLES
+    &openslES_bootstrap,
+#endif
 #ifdef SDL_AUDIO_DRIVER_PS2
     &PS2AUDIO_bootstrap,
 #endif
-- 
